# Optional: canonical origin for Open Graph / JSON-LD (default https://DermicIQ.com).
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://DermicIQ.com

# Vite asset base (production builds only):
# - Leave unset → derive from package.json "homepage" (e.g. /DermicIQ.com/ for GitHub project Pages).
# - VITE_BASE=/ → apex custom domain. Use: npm run build:apex

# Contact form (Cloudflare Turnstile + Worker):
# Create a Turnstile widget for dermiciq.com + localhost / 127.0.0.1 in the Cloudflare dashboard.
# Put the public site key in this repo-root .env (Vite envDir is the repo root).
# Keep the secret in the Worker (TURNSTILE_SECRET), not in Vite.
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAA...
#
# Optional override for the contact API (defaults to same-origin /api/contact).
# VITE_CONTACT_API_URL=/api/contact
#
# Optional override for account deletion requests (defaults to /api/account-deletion).
# VITE_ACCOUNT_DELETION_API_URL=/api/account-deletion
